      "spam": false,
      "value": "I personally think the limit for skinned mesh renderers should be quite strict, as long as it's clear as to why, and there is good documentation for combining meshes into one.\nMaterials could probably be more forgiving because it's a bit more complex joining up multiple textures and keeping them working right. That and often having more than one shader on different parts is required for some things.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
