  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think it would be good to add a soft and hard cap on skinned mesh renderers on avatars, possibly even materials. Cause' no one wants to see avatars with like 25 meshes and 70 materials.\nI still think the cap should be fairly forgiving, at least from the start to give the community time to learn how to properly optimize models as a whole.",
